cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its derived tables, please cite the paper below."
title: "Protein language models learn underlying mutation biases alongside fitness landscapes: figure engine"
abstract: >-
  Code and derived tables that redraw every figure of MacLean et al., "Protein language
  models learn underlying mutation biases alongside fitness landscapes". No model is run
  from this repository; it reads the scored output of the upstream analysis.
type: software
